sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Host as EVE host
    participant LLM
    participant Server as Wildfire server

    Note over User,Server: Prompt. The user chooses it.
    User->>Host: /wildfire_briefing place="Evia"
    Host->>Server: prompts/get wildfire_briefing
    Server-->>Host: User message template

    Note over Host,Server: Resource. The host loads it.
    Host->>Server: resources/read resource://aoi/evia
    Server-->>Host: AOI polygon as GeoJSON

    Note over Host,Server: Tool. The model calls it.
    Host->>LLM: Message, AOI, and tool list
    LLM->>Host: Call get_effis_burnt_areas(bbox, date)
    Host->>Server: tools/call get_effis_burnt_areas
    Server-->>Host: Fires with area_ha, commune, firedate
    Host->>LLM: Observation
    LLM-->>User: Briefing that cites each tool
